      "content": "it's just not \"stress\" or some \"life change\" though. it's final. like, there's this wall between me and everyone else and it's permanent. i look at them and i just see a version of my life that i'm not allowed to be part of anymore. it's like i'm already dead to them, so why am i even still trying to exist in this space? it just feels so pointless.",
